.nh
.TH KUBERNETES(1) kubernetes User Manuals
Eric Paris
Jan 2015

.SH "نام (NAME)"
kubeadm join phase control-plane-join \- Join a machine as a control plane instance


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBkubeadm join phase control-plane-join\fP [OPTIONS]


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Join a machine as a control plane instance


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--rootfs\fP=""
	The path to the 'real' host root filesystem. This will cause kubeadm to chroot into the provided path.

.PP
\fB--version\fP=false
	--version, --version=raw prints version information and quits; --version=vX.Y.Z... sets the reported version


.SH "مثال (EXAMPLE)"
.EX
  # Joins a machine as a control plane instance
  kubeadm join phase control-plane-join all
.EE


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBkubeadm-join-phase(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-join-phase-control-plane-join-all(1)\fP, \fBkubeadm-join-phase-control-plane-join-mark-control-plane(1)\fP,


